"U-class, for Unique, covers unusual powers that fit none of the normal classes."
"A U-class is not necessarily stronger than other classes."
"The Body Drainer was a U-class."
"Unique classes are affixed automatically, with no grace period, and cannot be traded."
"Bike Meister is a one-of-a-kind class held by a motorcycle goddess of a hero."
"U-type powers are often mismatched, and they usually start with no spell impression."
"U-types can rank up; one went from A to S and phases through solid objects."
